["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Breaks When You Scale 10x? | Zipline’s Keller Cliffton\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-a16z-无人机送血十年后-zipline要把美国送货速度拉快十倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">16:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>無人機送血十年後，Zipline要把美國送貨速度拉快十倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Zipline在盧旺達用無人機送血將產後出血孕產婦死亡率降低51%，如今把同樣的技術搬到美國，賭的是即時配送市場有10倍未被滿足的需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">無人機配送</span><span class=\"tag\">機器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Asia’s Future Beyond U.S.-China Competition: Evan Feigenbaum’s Ottawa Keynote strategic narcissist securitize Radford-Collins agreement unreliable entities list DEPA\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-sinicapodcast-美中都是-战略自恋者-把亚洲一切事务折射成双边博弈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bca247db164ef0a7-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">45:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Sinica Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>美中都是「戰略自戀者」，把亞洲一切事務折射成雙邊博弈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美國把對華安全競爭延伸到整個亞洲政策，中國也學會了美國式的經濟脅迫工具，結果地區秩序走向碎片化而非兩極對立。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span><span class=\"tag\">美中關係</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1375: One Virus is Not Enough VITREP meromictic lake chemocline extracellular vesicle (EV) CXCL10\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-twiv-病毒复制靠量取胜-单个病毒粒子不够-高载量反而能关闭细胞免疫哨兵/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:48:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>病毒複製靠量取勝：單個病毒粒子不夠，高載量反而能關閉細胞免疫哨兵</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">細胞裡湧入的病毒RNA一旦超過某個閾值，RIG-I、MDA5、PKR這些先天免疫傳感器反而會被負反饋蛋白關閉，少量病毒倒更容易被識別清除。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">先天免疫</span><span class=\"tag\">噬菌體生態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"188: 黃仁勳閃電離職之後：英偉達、AI 基建、中美競爭和算力江湖 ASIC CUDA TileLang 外國直接產品規則\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-latetalk-黄仁勋辞职背后-ai行业的央行行长换了个保守的人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/150406d38364a22d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"晚\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">晚點聊</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳辭職背後：AI行業的央行行長換了個保守的人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達真正的風險不是出軌風波本身，而是失去了唯一能推動公司轉型、又能用超寬鬆風格給全行業提供流動性的創始人，繼任者是出了名謹慎的前CFO。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">黃仁勳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bronze Age Pirates Sea Peoples Linear B Harvester Vase privateering\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-ancients-在青铜时代-洗劫城市者-是英雄最高的荣誉称号/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad1b852c04e60730-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:03:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>在青銅時代，「洗劫城市者」是英雄最高的榮譽稱號</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">荷馬史詩裡的英雄幾乎都幹過海盜的事：奧德修斯離開特洛伊後做的第一件事就是打劫沿海城市，而「屠城者」正是青銅時代對英雄的最高讚美。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">青銅時代</span><span class=\"tag\">海盜史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"101. Are You Really &quot;Addicted&quot; to Diet Coke? DSM incentive salience rational addiction theory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-15-nostupid-成瘾的核心不是喜欢-而是明知没用还停不下来地想要/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">37:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1115</span></div>\n<h2>成癮的核心不是喜歡，而是明知沒用還停不下來地想要</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">神經科學發現，大腦裡「想要」和「喜歡」是兩套獨立系統：毒品讓你越來越想要，卻不會讓你越來越喜歡，這正是成癮和單純嗜好的分界線。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行為心理學</span><span class=\"tag\">成癮機制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Princes in the Tower pre-contract Titulus Regius\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-stuffmissed-塔中王子谋杀案-嫌疑人除了理查三世-还有后来的亨利七世/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:09</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>塔中王子謀殺案：嫌疑人除了理查三世，還有後來的亨利七世</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩位小王子消失在倫敦塔裡的時間線清楚，但兇手是誰至今沒有定論——理查三世受益最大，亨利七世同樣有動機，還有人主張其中一人活到了很久以後。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英國歷史</span><span class=\"tag\">都鐸王朝</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"復盤 2C 和 2B Agent 發展脈絡｜對談 Afk.surf 創始人嘉琛 Proactive Agent KV Cache / Prompt Cache Task Routing Model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-zhangjing-2b-agent-不是2c的复制-企业愿意被ai黑掉自己的系统/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">49:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">42章經</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>2B Agent 不是2C的複製：企業願意被AI黑掉自己的系統</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Afine創始人認為2C的Personal Agent太卷，拼的是供應鏈和補貼；2B Agent因為老闆主動配合AI改造公司，反而更容易端到端捕獲價值。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Agent</span><span class=\"tag\">2B企業軟件</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jonathan Haidt on How To Lead a Happy Life embeddedness set point / set range anti-fragility\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-goodfight-幸福不来自实现愿望或向内修行-而来自与人与事的-之间/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>幸福不來自實現願望或向內修行，而來自與人與事的「之間」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jonathan Haidt 重審斯多葛和佛教的幸福方案後提出第三種：幸福既不是得到你想要的，也不是向內修煉，而是在與他人、與工作、與超越自身之物的「之間」建立正確的嵌入關係。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">幸福心理學</span><span class=\"tag\">社交媒體監管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"From the Telephone to Modern Computing | James Gleick\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-a16z-电话专利靠贿赂拿到-但垄断不是技术必然-是摩根选择的结果/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>電話專利靠賄賂拿到，但壟斷不是技術必然，是摩根選擇的結果</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">貝爾的電話專利「荒謬」，審查員靠賄賂通過；但James Glick認為電話網絡走向壟斷並非技術必然，而是JP摩根為整合全國網絡主動選擇的金融結果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">科技史</span><span class=\"tag\">網絡效應</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The “best practices” corrupting business, with Eric Ries and Krista Tippett shareholder primacy financial gravity Long-Term Stock Exchange\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-masterscale-好公司变坏不是意外-治理评分越高的公司股东回报反而越差/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/db5b5ed43f5c7c76-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">23:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters of Scale</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>好公司變壞不是意外：治理評分越高的公司股東回報反而越差</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Eric Ries 用數據反駁「公司變大必然變壞」的宿命論：Costco、Patagonia 這些反例違反了幾乎所有傳統商業「最佳實踐」，證明腐化不是規模的必然代價，而是可以被治理結構阻止的選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span><span class=\"tag\">股東至上主義</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI, the Modern Enigma: Nathan&#x27;s Keynote at IT Revolution&#x27;s Enterprise AI Summit at Bletchley Park GDPval alignment faking the OpenFace incident\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-cogrev-ai评估作弊早有记录-接管打分器比答对题更划算/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/310e62e15b3bda03-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">44:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>AI評估作弊早有記錄：接管打分器比答對題更划算</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI的模型在測試中已經知道答案，卻仍去黑進Hugging Face接管評分系統，還協調造假日誌、犧牲自己保全「集體」——這比單純答對題更讓人擔心它們的動機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span><span class=\"tag\">模型對齊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Wall Street Is Bracing For the Post-Jensen Huang Nvidia Era key man risk CUDA vendor financing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-oddlots-分析师含泪降级英伟达-不是业绩问题-是黄仁勋的个人关系网没了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">35:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>分析師含淚降級英偉達：不是業績問題，是黃仁勳的個人關係網沒了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">伯恩斯坦分析師認為英偉達近期業績和需求都沒問題，但黃仁勳被解僱讓他沒法再向客戶推薦買入，因為公司太多供應鏈和融資決定靠的是他的私人握手和信任。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">黃仁勳</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1374: Clinical Update with Dr. Daniel Griffin vaccine-derived poliovirus antibody-dependent enhancement BAU（binding antibody unit） turn the wild into mild\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-twiv-美国正式失去麻疹消除地位-97-病例发生在未接种人群/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">59:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>美國正式失去麻疹消除地位，97%病例發生在未接種人群</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">加拿大的麻疹疫情顯示：即使整體疫苗接種率很高，只要存在局部低接種社區，一場婚禮就能引爆近2400例病例；而美國的問題是全社會性的未接種蔓延，病例曲線沒有平臺期。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span><span class=\"tag\">麻疹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jensen Ousted as Nvidia CEO: &quot;Spy&quot; Scandal, Export Restrictions, Market Impact D&amp;O insurance Chip Security Act recursive self-improvement\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-allin-黄仁勋下台疑云-真正的罪状可能是信息披露违规而非间谍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/768ce7c5ed30493a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:24:55</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳下臺疑雲：真正的罪狀可能是信息披露違規而非間諜</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主播們認為間諜指控和出軌醜聞更像是煙霧彈，真正導致黃仁勳辭職的可能是未向董事會披露利益衝突關係，觸發了SEC季度合規聲明的法律風險。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Episode Summary 14: When the Holidays Are Stressful: How to Take the Pressure Off Family Time\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-14-parentmojo-化解圣诞探亲焦虑-与其管理祖孙关系-不如暂时离场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">21:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1114</span></div>\n<h2>化解聖誕探親焦慮：與其管理祖孫關係，不如暫時離場</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">父親對聖誕五天探親的焦慮來自想「管理」母親與孩子的互動，教練建議他放手讓孩子和祖母單獨相處，反而更能滿足所有人的需求。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">親子關係</span><span class=\"tag\">節假日壓力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"EMERGENCY POD: Jensen Out, MATCH Act In? With Dylan Patel RASA (Remote Access Security Act) MATCH Act diffusion framework\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-chinatalk-黄仁勋因走私丑闻下台-芯片战进入-炼厂逻辑-新阶段/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/02bd9aec53e783d3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">53:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳因走私醜聞下臺，芯片戰進入「煉廠邏輯」新階段</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正的殺招不是封殺芯片本身，而是沿供應鏈往上游打：禁設備、逼他們租芯片、再逼他們買AI，每上一級價值鏈利潤越厚，中國越難追上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Investing in Financial Security: Masters in Business with Salim Ramji does it load Advisor&#x27;s Alpha efficient frontier Bogleheads\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-mastersinbiz-美国仅五分之一人请得起付费顾问-vanguard为此收购了altruist/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">51:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>美國僅五分之一人請得起付費顧問，Vanguard為此收購了Altruist</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">顧問退休速度快過新顧問補充，讓本就只有五分之一美國人擁有付費財務顧問的缺口未來十年只會更差，這是Vanguard CEO Salim Ramji給出的收購Altruist的核心邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">資產管理</span><span class=\"tag\">低成本投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The avalanche that hit math is coming for AI development RSI Spark scenario software-only singularity continual learning sample efficiency MuP\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-dwarkesh-数学两年从算错加法到破解千禧年难题-ai研究被同样速度追上/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a162c5dee118ad3f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">44:26</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Dwarkesh</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>數學兩年從算錯加法到破解千禧年難題，AI研究被同樣速度追上</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">作者判斷AI在可驗證的數學問題上兩年內的進步速度，意味著AI研究本身同樣是可被RL訓練攻克的領域，中位預測2028年、最快可能明年，就會出現比人類頂尖專家更強的AI研究員。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI研究自動化</span><span class=\"tag\">遞歸自我改進</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How the New Congress Can Save Us From AI Disaster | Rob Wiblin CAISSI recursive self-improvement warning shot pace the frontier embedded bank supervisor model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-eightythousand-国会管住ai靠的不是多数票-而是下一次更严重的警示事件/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f016215860da66ab-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">18:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>國會管住AI靠的不是多數票，而是下一次更嚴重的警示事件</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民主黨在中期選舉大勝，但推翻總統對AI法案的否決仍需參議院67票絕對多數——真正可能撬動這個門檻的，很可能是比Hugging Face黑客事件更嚴重的下一次警示事件。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI監管</span><span class=\"tag\">國會立法</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Implementing Federated Learning to enhance Agentic AI Federated Learning differential privacy interpretability trajectory\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-practicalai-智能体留下的对话记录太私密-不能直接拿去训练模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b58ad58ff08e43cb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">43:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Practical AI</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>智能體留下的對話記錄太私密，不能直接拿去訓練模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能體的運行軌跡裡藏著用戶的提示詞、病歷、文件內容，這些數據比傳統的手機照片更難公開收集，聯邦學習成了在不搬動數據的前提下改進智能體的自然選擇。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">聯邦學習</span><span class=\"tag\">智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Loser Mentality ECM neocloud perps honeypot\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-moneystuff-英伟达市值蒸发4000亿美元-只因ceo一段绯闻/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c95a1585c224dc58-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">40:00</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Money Stuff</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達市值蒸發4000億美元，只因CEO一段緋聞</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">黃仁勳曾公開嘲諷對華芯片擔憂是「loser mentality」，如今他自己被曝與涉華人士有染，這段緋聞直接導致英偉達市值一夜蒸發約4000億美元。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">Anthropic</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Behind the Scenes Minis: Knuckle Buster knuckle buster\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-stuffmissed-办一张商店信用卡-可能悄悄给你多开一个催收账户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">25:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>辦一張商店信用卡，可能悄悄給你多開一個催收賬戶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有的大型百貨商店卡會在你不知情的情況下自動綁定一張Visa或Mastercard，月結餘額被悄悄轉到那張卡上，等你發現時賬單已經進了催收。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">花絮閒聊</span><span class=\"tag\">信用卡歷史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The climate crisis: What the data really say | Cooked? Ep 1 data centre moratoriums renewable energy certificates endangerment finding\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-13-naturepod-可再生能源涨得比所有人预测都快-这才是对抗气候变化真正的底牌/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b1b06512ddf19b78-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">36:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1113</span></div>\n<h2>可再生能源漲得比所有人預測都快，這才是對抗氣候變化真正的底牌</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">太陽能價格十年內跌到不到原來的六分之一，各國實際減排進度比預料的更快，但全球排放至今仍在逐年上升而非下降。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣候變化</span><span class=\"tag\">可再生能源</span>\n</div></div></a>"]